                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A graph L(G) which is derived from a given non-oriented graph G such that the vertices of L(G) represent edges of G and so that a clique in L(G) represents a common end-vertex shared by a set of represented edges. (A star subgraph in G transforms into a clique in L(G).)",
                                            "A graph which is the line graph (in the above sense) of some other graph."
